sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant RAG as RAGSystem
  participant Ret as Retriever
  participant Rank as Ranker
  participant Gen as Generator
  participant Mem as Memory
  U->>RAG: ask(question)
  RAG->>Mem: add_user
  RAG->>Ret: retrieve(k, filters)
  Ret-->>RAG: candidates
  RAG->>Rank: rank(query, candidates)
  Rank-->>RAG: top final_k
  RAG->>RAG: assemble prompt + citations
  RAG->>Gen: generate(prompt)
  Gen-->>RAG: answer grounded?
  RAG->>Mem: add_assistant
  RAG-->>U: RAGAnswer
